window.products.push({"id":967018,"name":"Cocktail Smoker Kit with 6 Flavor Wood Chips, Old Fashioned Smoker Kit Drink Whiskey Smoker Infuser Kit for Cocktail, Infuse Whiskey, Wine, Bourbon, M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WrdK+BAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DRINKING EXPERIENCE - This cocktail smoker kit mixes the smell of the drink and the natural wood, bringing you a new gastronomic and spiritual experience. This cocktail smoky kit will create a quick and soft smoky flavour for your drink, giving you a full sensory experience of cocktails and drinks that will leave you lingering. EASY TO USE - The old fashioned smoker kit is easy to use, whether you are a beginner or a professional, you can use our smoked cocktail shaker and amaze your friends! Put a whiskey smoker infuser kit on your rock glass, add flavored natural smoking wood chips and ignite it to create a cascading waterfall of cooking smoke. Wait a few seconds and the flavored drink is ready. MULTI-PURPOSE SMOKING KIT - This drink smoker cocktail smoked kit is suitable for most wine glasses and specially designed glass smoking bells. Not only is it suitable for whiskey smokers, it can also be used in cocktails, wine and bourbon, cheese, desserts, coffee, ice cream, meat and barbecue. SIX FLAVOR WOOD CHIPS - Our cocktail smoke kit contains six different flavored wood chips (apple, pear, oak, hickory, beech and cherry wood chips). Six different wood chips add depth to each flavor, giving you a clear taste of smoked natural wood while enhancing the flavors of your food and spirits. GREAT GIFT CHOICE - This whiskey smoker infuser kit is an ideal gift choice for cocktail and whiskey lovers, bartenders, dads, boyfriends. Perfect as Christmas, Birthday, Father's Day and Valentine's Day gifts, also suitable for many occasions, parties, family dinners, bars and outdoor tastings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WrdK+BAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAZODA","source_asin":"B09R3VFJ41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R3VFJ41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R3VFJ41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
