window.products.push({"id":967072,"name":"HAOCOO Round Area Rugs 3ft Rustic Floral Beige Soft Velvet Contemporary Throw Rug Non-Slip Country Style Romantic Fresh Floor Carpet for Bedroom Livin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n8tKZBIvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN COLLECTION DESIGN- HAOCOO Country Area Rugs adopted printing and dyeing, creating a colorful and beautiful small floral pattern. Based on beige color as background color, unique rustic floral design made the rugs are full of sense of elegance and fashion, not only can bring your feet warmth but also make it ideal for decorating and completing the look of your living space. UPGRADE NON SLIP BACKING- This floor carpet constructed of ultra soft velvet with 100% environmental thermoplastic rubber. It has skid resistant features, which allows it stay in place.(No additional rug pad needed) Anti-slip base rug is a perfect choice for ceramic tile or wooden floor. DIMENSIONS&MATERIAL- The Play Mat size is approximately 3' diameter round. Made of 100% Polyester, the area rug ensures a super soft and comfortable feel, providing a warm spa-like experience under your feet. With Low pile feature, suitable for any area of your home. VERSATILE AREA RUG- This versatile farmhouse rug is available in a variety of sizes and colors options to suit your personal style and preferences. You can use it in living room, bedroom, nursery, dining room, kid’s room,entryway, hallways, back door, or in front of fireplace. This floral rug will be a charming addition to your space and enhances the decor. EASY TO CARE- The accent rug allows to machine wash in cold water with mild detergent, color will not fade and microfiber will not easy to drop off. Do not tumble dry, do not bleach. Or using a vacuum (without a beater bar) regularly will help prevent dust and dirt build-up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n8tKZBIvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAOCOO","source_asin":"B082CWVHNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082CWVHNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082CWVHNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
