window.products.push({"id":967129,"name":"JIALIPOK 4500mAh Replacement for Dyson V10 Battery, Compatible with Dyson V10 Animal V10 Absolute V10 Motorhead SV12 V10 Fluffy 25.2V Lithium ion Cord","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ghuvycKrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔋【Great Replacement for Dyson V10】100% Brand New 25.2V | 4.5Ah | lithium-ion battery. The 25.2V replacement battery for Dyson V10 has high capacity can extend service life 30% than most ordinary battery in the market. Repeated tested to match over 5 Dyson V10 Stick Vacuum Cleaners. 🔋【Higher Capacity】 The replacement Dyson V10 4.5 Ah higher capacity battery for Dyson V10 Vacuum Cleaners. Made with Top-A grade battery cell and repeated tested to match original for Dyson V10 Vacuum Cleaners, the replacement battery has no memory effect, is more powerful, longer-lasting. 🔋【100% COMPATIBILITY WITH Dyson V10】The replacement Dyson V10 compatible with Dyson Cyclone V10 SV12 Animal, Dyson V10 Absolute, Dyson V10 Motorhead, Fluffy Lightweight Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner. The performance is 40% better than the original and the same size as the original and fits for V10 OEM original charger and wall-charger/holder unit. 🔋【EASY TO INSTALL】Replacement for V10 battery's size and function are the same as the OEM battery. Steady blue means charging, flashing red means error occurred. Note: Charged with original V10 charger about 3 hours which can work in 30 minutes at normal mode. Let the battery cool down 10-20 minutes Before charging. Using Standard mode first in everyday use, MAX mode will shorten use time. 🔋【Safety & Reliable】 Dyson V10 replacement batteries with three LED lights on the battery, each light means approx. 33% of power, that display the remaining power and reduce the risk of downtime work, allowing you to monitor charge levels conveniently. Protect against overcharge, over-discharge, overpower, over-temperature, overcurrent, short circuit. 🔋All Jialipok products come with 30 days free return, 12 months quality service and 24 hours' friendly customer service. Any other problems with this battery adapter, please feel free to contact us. Please click the \"Ask a question\" on our storefront or in \"YOUR ORDER\" options click the \"contact seller\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ghuvycKrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIALIPOK","source_asin":"B08P5B39C4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P5B39C4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P5B39C4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":967130,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Quattro Stagioni 8-1/2-Ounce 4-Piece Canning Jar Set, Gift Boxed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iYPJVtGAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Three decades ago, Bormioli Rocco , introduced the first ever preserving jar made of 100-percent glass. Today, the Quattro Stagioni Collection of home-canning jars includes various sizes of jars, bowls and even plates-each designed with charming old world Italian embossed decor and sealed with a signature gold metal lid. Quattro Stagioni is the leading brand preferred by consumers and the most used preserving jar in Italy. Quattro Stagioni jars offer many different uses in the kitchen, from storing dry food items such as pasta, flour, sugar, ground coffee or spices, to preserving fruits, vegetables, sauces or jams to keep fresh for up to one-year hence the name Quattro Stagioni which means four seasons in Italian.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iYPJVtGAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B00WM3ZU6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WM3ZU6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WM3ZU6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
