window.products.push({"id":967207,"name":"Professional Bartender Kit and Cocktail Shaker 27 Piece Kit - Bar Accessories - Mixology Bartender Kit, Barware Kit Including Wooden Muddler, Jigger, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PC26731JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete bartender kit: For all amateur and professional bartenders out there, this is the ultimate bartending kit you need. Our complete bartender kit includes two Boston shakers, one 27oz and one 20oz, plus a range of other bartending accessories to make the most exotic, delicious, mouth-watering cocktails you can imagine. Fabulous bar accessories: Our complete bartender kit comes with a variety of bar and cocktail accessories, which no mixologist should be without. Chill your cocktails with ice tongs, the bottle/wine opener are super-handy and with 4 liquor pourers, adding the different ingredients has never been easier. Use the julep strainers, large and small sizes to avoid any unwanted sediment - adding lemon with the squeezer. A 15ml and 30ml jigger and wooden muddle scale up your bartending skills! Perfect for parties and nights out: What better way to get a party started than by serving cocktails made by you with this complete bartender kit. Whether it’s for a party, a night in, or a night out, our complete bartender kit comes in a handy, highly portable canvas bag. Made with a tote bag material and an inner bag for extra protection, as well as dedicated pockets inside for each and every accessory of the kit, it’s the best pick-up-and-go bartending kit you will ever need. Stylish, elegant and rust resistant: We’ve made sure your bartender kit is not only stylish and elegant, the perfect way to grace any bar, it is also rust-resistant and durable. Highly attractive with a brushed finish, every piece of the bartender kit has been thoughtfully made with high quality, durable materials and coated to prevent rust. You’ll mix many drinks for years to come with this kit. A great gift idea: Looking for the perfect gift for friends or family that loves cocktails? Look no further; our complete bartender kit makes the ideal and highly practical gift for just about anyone. Whether it’s for a birthday or anniversary, or just to say thank you, this highly usable gift will get any party started in no time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PC26731JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pepe Nero","source_asin":"B08STVYP68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08STVYP68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08STVYP68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":967208,"name":"Payeel Sectional Sofa Set L-Shaped Couch Reversible Modular Futon Couch Furniture with Reversible Ottoman for Small Space Living Room (Dark Gray C)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hf7lD4ddL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convertible Sectional Sofa Set: Each seat of this set of sectional sofa is independent and can be combined at will.You can combine and change the whole set of sofa according to the needs of indoor space and position.And the seat is equipped with a connecting buckle which can connect each seat together without moving easily The sectional sofa cushion is filled with very soft foam,plus bottom springs to make it full of elasticity.The solid wood frame enhances the firmness of the sofa as a whole.The sofa is comfortable and sturdy,which brings you the best family life experience This L-shaped sofa couch includes an ottoman,ottoman can be used not only as an extra seat but also as a footrest.Or you can put the fruit tray on the ottoman so that you can taste the food when you rest on the sofa Overall Dimensions:80\"W x 80\"Dx 33.5\"H.Ottoman dimensions:23\"W x 29\"D x 18\"H.Chair 31\"W x 26\"D x 33.5\"H,Overall weight Capacity: 1800lbs. Seat Height - Floor to Seat:18\". Seat Depth - Front to Back: 20\".Product weight: 152lbs This sectional with ottoman is perfect for providing a parties and movie nights,setting the tone for your whole ensemble.Made from solid wood,it offers soft padding and polyester blend upholstery with gentle tufting and a neutral solid hue Simple assembly. No tools needed. Only takes about 20mins for one person to assemble. Easy-to-follow Installation instruction is included in packaging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hf7lD4ddL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Payeel","source_asin":"B092VYHGG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VYHGG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VYHGG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
