window.products.push({"id":967281,"name":"ZEN Pleats Porcelain Dessert Bowls 10oz Set of 6 (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VaFYuLjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eco-Friendly ZEN, the brand you can trust for quality. Light & Thin but Strong. It's made of ZEN white porcelain that's strong from chip Healthy Porcelain: Meets California Proposition 65 standards for lead and cadmium. Never worry about harmful toxins leaching into your food. Safe to use for your family EASY TO CLEAN – Unlike plastic products, food stain is easily removed by washing. Safe to use in dishwasher, freezer, microwave, and oven A subtly fluted releif detail highlights the classically elegant sculptural shapes of this fine china, the plain white or color glazed companion collection to match the exquisitely. 4.3\" diameter, 10 oz capacity","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VaFYuLjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEN","source_asin":"B08B11ZZ4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B11ZZ4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B11ZZ4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":967282,"name":"Pre-Seasoned Reversible Cast Iron Double Square Grill Nonstick Griddle Grill Cookware Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-3suCd5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description: Type: XG203 Product Dimension: 50.5 x 23.2 x 1.7 cm Weight: 4.33 kg Package Dimension: 53.3 x 25.2 x 3.4 cm Color: Black In the heating process, the blood in beef will seep out. Beef will be soaked in the gravy, so that beef cannot be heated in high temperature or will be uneven heated. If there are grooves on the skillet, the gravy will be drawn away and out of contact with the steak surface. In addition, the grooves will burn marks to increase the beauty of beef. Notes: 1. To prevent rust, the product surface is coated with vegetable oil. Please use the food detergent to clean it before use. Add a little cooking oil and heat it with soft fire for about 5 minutes. 2. Do not empty burn, please use a layer of thin oil on the surface of the pot before using. 3. Please do not heat up suddenly. 4. After heating, the pot will become very hot. To avoid burns, please use insulated gloves. 5. Please put on the table with table mat. 6. After use, you can gently wash with warm and a sponge or soft brush, and fully dry. Soap will remove the layers of seasoning and should be avoided. You may want to store with a paper towel on the top surface to absorb any moisture.  7. Due to iron is easy to rust, please pay attention to fully dry. With the edible oil penetrates into the pot, it will play a protective role, so the pot is not easy to rust and has the effect of a long-term use. 8. If the product surface is found rusted, do not worry. Firstly, pour appropriate amount of cooking oil into the pot and heat it for 2 minutes. Then, light wet a clean cloth gently with some warm oil to wipe rusty place, and then heated. Finally, remove the rust with soft brush or steel wool after heating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-3suCd5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PR PeakRous","source_asin":"B076DZ4WTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076DZ4WTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076DZ4WTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
