window.products.push({"id":967306,"name":"Breadsmart Artisan Bread Making Kit - 5PC Sourdough Bread Baking Supplies Set - Lame, Scraper, Whisk, Banneton Bread Proofing Basket & Cotton Liner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XTCAig-PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOUR COMPLETE SOURDOUGH STARTER KIT: Whether you're a novice or pro, Breadsmart has a premium quality set to get you rolling in the dough. From the bread basket with cotton liner, to the scraper, whisk, dual-edged lame and recipe ebook. TRIPLE-LOOPED DANISH DOUGH WHISK: Mix your flour, water, salt and yeast perfectly with this top grade stainless steel whisk. It has three sturdy loops and the whisk head runs the entire length of the handle and so won't bend or break. 3-IN-1 BENCH SCRAPER: This tool scrapes dough from bowls and counters, folds dough during mixing and the sharp edge cuts the dough to desired dimensions. It also features an embossed ruler for measuring the rise of dough during proofing! Very clever. BREAD PROOFER WITH COTTON LINER: This large proofing basket handles family-sized loaves. Made of sturdy BPA-free food safe plastic, it's durable and easy to clean. A cotton liner is included for extra sticky doughs, including gluten free varieties. DUAL-ENDED LAME WITH SPARE BLADES: This tool has blades at each end, one straight and one curved. So it can score any kind of design including intricate patterns. Included are 10 spare blades with numbered corners so it's easy to track dull edges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XTCAig-PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Breadsmart","source_asin":"B08KWLWBLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KWLWBLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KWLWBLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":967307,"name":"Petus PetusHouse 20 X 28 Inch LED Lighted Bathroom Mirrors, Black Frame Wall Mounted White Light Dimmable Defogger Memory Button Waterproof CRI>90, Ve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tyuRdOLCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【QUALITY FIRST】The PetusHouse led bathroom mirrors are made of TAIBO 5MM Copper-free glass which is at least twice more expensive than ordinary glass. It looks very textured, CRI >90 Ra, and won’t get rusty within 5 years. Black iron frame protect the mirror from breakage and keep this mirror always look like just bought, keep using 100% new LED bathroom mirror all the time. LED lifetime: at least 50,000 hours. Waterproof, LED Strip: IP65. Driver and Touch Part: IP44 and UL certificate. 【MEMORY DIMMABLE BUTTON& HARDWIRE】Holding the turn on/off button for a while to adjust your wanted brightness, this PetusHouse led bathroom mirror will memory your last time brightness and you needn't adjust it next time. Equipped with a plug itself. Besides, it's also hardwire available. We strongly recommended that do this job by a professional electrician. Hanging vertically. 【ANTI-FOG】Starting anti-fog function immediately when you turn on the anti-fog button, it need 5-10 minutes to clear this PetusHouse led bathroom mirror completely, safe and energy-saving, opening this function in advance before you use it(May need more time in Winter). And close the function when you needn't it. 【PACKAGE CONTENT】1 x Installation instruction, 2 x Screws, 1 x 20in x 28in PetusHouse LED bathroom mirror(White light/Daylight, Lumen: 2592) 【5 YEARS WARRANTY & CUSTOMER SERVICE】These PetusHouse LED bathroom mirrors are 100% original PetusHouse brand new. 5 Years warranty for quality issue. If you have any question, please feel free to contact us through amazon by email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tyuRdOLCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Petus PetusHouse","source_asin":"B0BV96B1FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV96B1FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV96B1FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
