window.products.push({"id":967351,"name":"Soroel 42 Inch Round Clear Plastic Table Protector for Dining Room Table PVC Tablecloth Protective Cover Pad Wood Furniture Vinyl Desk Blotter Mats Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UNvrzK33L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💕【UPGRADED CLEAR TABLE PROTECTOR】Soroel New Clear Vinyl Tablecloth Protector, plastic table cover is BPA FREE, no plastic smell and eco-friendly. The PVC sheet table protective mat is designed with rounded corners, ideal for families with kids and pregnant women. Clear plastic table protector pad is suitable for glass, marble, wooden table. The clear table cover mat is heat resistance (Maximum up to 176°F/80°C), oil-proof and waterproof, anti-coffee. 💕【THICKEN PVC TABLE COVER】1.5mm Thicken Customized Crystal Clear Tablecloth Protector, plastic vinyl tabletop cover, clear desk mats pad is durable, anti-scratch, wipeable and easy clean. Stains can be easily cleaned off with a damp cloth. Clear plastic tabletop protector won't move easily and protect your various furniture in daily life. It can be used as a dining room table pad, sofa, night stand, coffee table cover protector, kitchen countertop mat, bar, buffer, dinner table cover. 💕【CUT TO FIT】Our Custom Clear Plastic Vinyl Table Cover Mats are available in various sizes and shapes: round, square, rectangle and circle. And you can choose according to your need. The size of our table pad is slightly larger than the actual size to ensure that the shrinkage, this is not the size of the error. If cutting is required, just mark the dimensions with pencil and cut with sharp scissors or a steel ruler. 💕【MULTIPURPOSE CLEAR TABLE MAT】Soroel Clear PVC Table Pad Protector is perfect designed for wood, glass, marble and granite table surface. It is good as conference table pad, office computer writing desk mat, TV console cover protector, pet food bowl mat, end side table dresser cover, chair or hard floor mat. NOTE: Don't Place a Clear Table Mat Directly on a Brand New or Freshly Painted wooden table top, Please Place a Fabric Tablecloth Under the Table Pad First. 💕【100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION】We Guarantee the Excellent Quality of Our PVC Table Mat. We Offer 24-hour Customer Service and a One-year Warranty. The clear plastic desk table pad mat is roller packed, so the PVC table cover sheet protector mat may be a little wrinkled and warped. Warm Tips: A. Lay it out flat in the sun for a day; B. Roll up the table cover in reverse direction and put heavy items over it; C. Heating it with hair dryer to make it flat; D. Use the iron on the curled places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UNvrzK33L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soroel","source_asin":"B09V56GKKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V56GKKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V56GKKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
