window.products.push({"id":967383,"name":"Chunk waffle maker - Portable Sandwich Maker - Multi-function Breakfast Maker, 3-in-1 Detachable Non-stick Coating aluminum, overheat and power-off pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t-MumN0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How To Make Food: 1.Combine the flour with the baking powder together. 2.In another bowl whisk all the wet ingredients together; eggs, sugar, milk, vanilla extract and butter. 3.Add the wet ingredients to the flour mixture and whisk well until well combined. This is it for your batter. 4.Heat sanwich maker well. Once heated add about a ladleful of the batter to the iron and close the lid. Bake for about 3 to 4 minutes, lift the lid and remove the food. Features: ▶MINI SIZE Built for small spaces, this sandwich maker takes up minimal cabinet space. ▶HEAT-INSULATING HANDLE Remains comfortable to touch to prevent burns and easy to carry. ▶SAFETY COVER LATCH Ensures that the lid is secured while cooking. ▶CORD-STORAGE Say goodbye to the messy power cord and make it easier to store. Specification: - Color: White - Main material: Cast Aluminum - Detachable Plate: Sandwich Plate, Waffle Plate, Donut Plate - Grill Plate Size: 1.58\"x 1.38\" - Item Dimension: 9.84\" * 2.6\" *1 .6\" (L*W*H) - Input: 600w, 120 V, 60 Hz Package Include: 1 x Waffle & Sandwich Maker 1 x Sandwich Plate( Grill Plate) 1 x Waffle Plate 1 x Donut Plate 1x User Manual Tips: The brand new 3 in 1 waffle maker will produce a burnt smell of plastic when it is used for the first time, please don't worry, this is a normal phenomenon. The smell will disappear after a few more uses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t-MumN0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KISAVIOUR","source_asin":"B09939RY9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09939RY9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09939RY9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
