window.products.push({"id":967391,"name":"Meinhom Knife Sharpener Manual Kitchen Knife Scissors Sharpening Tool Helps Repair Restore and Polish Blades 3-Stage Diamond and Ceramic Coated Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bo1vrjOTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What drives you crazy while cooking at home? Blunt knife fails to cut the food while the hardly smooth cutting the food, makes the cooking badly annoying. It is time to polish your knife to make your cooking more convenient. Then our ceramic knife sharpener will be your best choice! How knife sharpening kit works: StageⅠ -The bonus scissors grinding slot is designed to take care of your blunt scissor. StageⅡ - Preparation (High grade Diamond rods). This 'roughens' the knife edge to prepare the surface for sharpening. It also smooths any nicks and imperfections that could cause the blade to 'catch' during the sharpening stage(a common problem with 1 and 2 stage pull through sharpeners which can cause damage to blades). StageⅢ - Sharpen (Hardened Tungsten Carbide Plates) - Now pull the blade through slot 2's precision angled tungsten carbide plates to create the perfect sharpened 'V' edge on even the bluntest knife. Stage IV - Hone (Ceramic Stone Rods) - For final edge honing. It removes any burs and gently polishes the blade edges for a super sharp finish. Knife Sharpener features : 1. Easy and quick to sharpen your knives.2. Make your knives forever sharp3.Nice handle and non skid pads. You can securely Handheld Sharpening for Blade without worrying about cutting yourself. 4.Protect your knife, This knife sharpener takes away very little metal on your edge and Without removing more blade metal than. So if you are looking for a way to increase the life of all your knives, I can only advise you to invest in this knife sharpener!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bo1vrjOTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIOLI","source_asin":"B07C1GQRTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C1GQRTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C1GQRTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
