window.products.push({"id":967658,"name":"Superior Premium Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover Set, All Season 100% Brushed Cotton Flannel Bedding, 2-Piece Set with Duvet Cover and Pillow Sham - Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+UI4dK0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"***Impressions is now Superior brand***  Affordable Luxury Linens Give your bed a stylish look and a trendy new layer of comfort with this 100-percent cotton flannel duvet cover set. The flannel is cozy and warm in winter and is equally comfortable in summer, thanks to the breathable cotton construction. Flannel fabric is more wrinkle resistant than standard cotton weaves, and is brushed on both sides to transform your bed into a blissfully cozy retreat. Available in a variety of sizes and in solid and paisley patterns, these flannel bedding sets are perfect to give an elegant look to your bedroom. The duvet covers are closed with clear and hidden buttons, and the included pillow shams have an envelope closure for a neat appearance.  A versatile color palette of grey, ivory, light blue, navy blue, pumpkin, and purple is a great way to update your décor. The perfect luxurious texture and rich colors mesh beautifully to complement your bedroom interior. Add matching sheet sets and extra pillowcases, or mix and match solid and paisley for a fantastic, coordinating look. This beautiful duvet cover set is machine washable, colorfast and wears extremely well. For drying, tumble dry low and remove promptly from dryer. Always follow care label instructions for best results. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: “Love it! Feels great - lovely color, fits well!” “These flannel duvet covers are awesome. Warm and soft!” “AMAZING set! Exactly what I was looking for! Can't wait for bed every night” “Great duvet set. Makes my bed very warm… Will definitely buy more” “Very pretty and the quality is very good! Very warm with my down comforter inside!” “Perfect ! Very warm and comfy =)” And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+UI4dK0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B0C632NY5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C632NY5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C632NY5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
