window.products.push({"id":967724,"name":"Pure Bliss VersiFlex Mattress Boxspring Foundation - Twin 8\". Ideal for Memory Foam, Latex, and air mattresses.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zY29rnz1L._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"Introducing the VersiFlex, the original state-of-the-art collapsible mattress foundation that is a breeze to move in and out of your home, and stronger than the old traditional models. It is made from solid Spruce, requires only 6 carriage bolts, and can be fully assembled in less than 10 minutes. With a simple, one-of-a-kind design, the entire foundationl fits in a box that measures only 76\" x 10\" x 10\"! Advantages: * 10 minutes approximate assembly time, * No additional tools required, * Easy to disassemble and store, * Easily transport in a minivan or SUV, * Fits into attics, townhomes, and up tight stairwells, * Higher quality wood means better performance and durability, * Simple Assembly. Assembly Instructions: Step 1: Connecting the side rails. Lay the side rails and one end beam on the floor. Line-up both side rails with the channels on the end beam. Insert the bolts through the hols on both corners of the end beam and tighten. Step 2: Connecting the Center Rail. Place the center rail through the middle of the end beam. (There are no bolts necessary to secure this rail to the end beam.) Then insert two bolts through the holes found on both outside corners of the end beam and tighten. Step 3: Positioning the slats. Simply place the roll of slats on the top of the wooden structure at one end. Set the first slat behind the peg and unroll the slats across the top of the foundation. Set the last slat behind the other peg. (You may have to pull tight to get the slats snug). Step 4: Covering the foundation. Slip the cover over the corner edges of the foundation with the fabric out. Lift the foundation onto it's side and pull the draw string tight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zY29rnz1L._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Bliss","source_asin":"B07CHXY4DB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHXY4DB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHXY4DB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
