window.products.push({"id":967882,"name":"Boxy Concepts Hat Rack - 10 Shelf Hanging Closet Hat Organizer for Baseball Caps - Hat Storage to Protect Your Caps with this Hat Hanger - Easy Hat Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hnQ9t0HpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Keep Your Hats Looking Good - If you want to look good then your hats need to look good too. Protect your headwear from creases, dents and folds with this home-essential hat organizer closet. Make misshapen hats a thing of the past! ✅ Un-clutter Your Home - Hats starting to take up precious closet space? Caps been living on coat pegs too long? Get smart, save space and de-clutter your living area with this specially-made hanging hat rack. ✅ Store Them All - Boxy Concepts cap storage has 10 separate shelves, each specially sized to house your headwear. Keep your entire hat collection stored safely in one place with the best closet organizers and storage cube. ✅ Easy Simple Hanging Design - Who said fitting new storage was a chore? This zero-stress hat hanger easily unfolds like an accordion and fastens to your wardrobe clothing rail with a tough velcro fastener. Quick, easy and super-useful. ✅ Money Back Guarantee! - You’ll love keeping all your hats tidy and safe in one place. So much so that we’re confidently offering a 30-day money-back guarantee on every purchase!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hnQ9t0HpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boxy Concepts","source_asin":"B07W37PJNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W37PJNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W37PJNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":967883,"name":"Magnetic Wooden Photo Frame - Fits 5 x 7 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1SgHRP6EGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Frame It, Change It, Love It! All of our items are individually handcrafted, never mass produced, and Proudly made in the USA.   Simply place your photo on top of the base and place the trim on top. The trims and bases are embedded with magnets and they will snap together and securely hold your photo in place. All of our items are individually handcrafted from high quality recycled wood product, hand painted and distressed with love. Each comes with sawtooth hangers for both orientations.   Testimonial From Kristy in Medford New Jersey   Where to begin...   I received a frame set as a gift and couldn't be happier that I did.   The quality and craftsmanship is wonderful!   These are the absolute simplest frames to use as well as being very attractive. I have received tons of compliments on it. I also received 2 ornaments as well and I love putting them on my tree, they can also be used for a year round decorations they are that versatile!   I plan to order some of the interchangeable ones to use on the pictures I keep on my fridge. When purchasing from Thistle and Poppy keep in mind how well made and attractive they are!   What a great product you won't be sad you did and will want to purchase more for yourself or as a gift.   Thanks Thistle and Poppy for a great gift!   Kristy H.  Medford, NJ   Testtimonial From Grace At 'Beyond The Wonderlust'   I really really love these snap point frames! Not only for my own home, but as gifts for baby showers, wedding showers, holidays, etc. - they rock!   The interchangeable design leaves you with options and gives you the flexibility to frequently change your photos without hassle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1SgHRP6EGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thistle & Poppy","source_asin":"B019FCWISK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019FCWISK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019FCWISK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
