window.products.push({"id":967919,"name":"Creative Converting Florida State Seminoles Crepe Paper Streamer Roll, 30-Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ndZSLozsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your football gathering decor can now match your preferred team disposable party supplies. 30-Foot roll of crepe paper streamer is done in Seminoles school colors and is printed with the Florida State University logo. Decorate your banquet tables, windows, walls, light fixtures, walkway to the front door and more. Back your favorite divisions and teams with Creative Converting's championship-worthy NCAA football college collections featuring paper plates, napkins, cups and matching tablecloths, all available to purchase separately. Creative Converting has successfully transformed Florida State University game-watching get together, FSU college graduations and FL sports fan's birthdays into unforgettable memories with this complete line of disposable paper tableware and fun collegiate decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ndZSLozsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B0082AK028","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082AK028","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082AK028","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
