window.products.push({"id":967954,"name":"FREASEIT Food Vacuum Sealer Bag Roll , BPA Free Heavy Duty Embossed Plastic Sealer Packing Bag（4 rolls 11\"x16.5'）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qdlblhNBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us FREASEIT attaches great importance to product quality. The carefully selected food-grade high-density pure nylon PE without BPA ensures durability in daily use. This sealer bag is smooth on one side and embossed on the other side. LFGB approves these food sealer bags and rolls. Why Choose Our Vacuum Sealer Bag for Food? High transparency: You can see the freshness and quality for more convenience; High transparency: You can see the freshness and quality for more convenience; Oil resistance: It can prevent free fat in oily food from penetrating to the outside of the film; Oil resistance: It can prevent free fat in oily food from penetrating to the outside of the film; Low-temperature resistance: The strength and impact resistance of the bag can still be maintained under a low-temperature environment; Low-temperature resistance: The strength and impact resistance of the bag can still be maintained under a low-temperature environment; High-temperature resistance: You can directly package food for heating. No compound decomposition will occur during the boiling process; High-temperature resistance: You can directly package food for heating. No compound decomposition will occur during the boiling process; High barrier: Separate the air as much as possible, avoid the contact between moist and moisture and the product to affect the flavor. High barrier: Separate the air as much as possible, avoid the contact between moist and moisture and the product to affect the flavor. Wide Applicability These food sealer vacuum packing bags are ideal for all kinds of clamp style vacuum sealer machines (except exhaust nozzle type) to store cooked food, meat, seafood, nuts, fruits, vegetables, micro-oil, and other products, keeping food fresh and tasty. After Sales Service If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We are committed to providing you with a pleasant shopping experience. Tips 1. Please tear a small opening when heating 2. The use effect is related to the temperature of food storage Specifications Material ... Pure nylon PE Package Contents 4 * Food vacuum sealer bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qdlblhNBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NO","source_asin":"B08831C62S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-967954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08831C62S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08831C62S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
