window.products.push({"id":968001,"name":"Slicious Kitchen Wrap Dispenser - 3-in-1 Foil Storage Cutter with Compartments - Bamboo Wood Foil Dispenser with Cutter & Labels - Wall Mount Foil Alu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vS7C-qrGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅At Slicious, we know how difficult it can be to keep your home tidy and organized. For those of you who want to enjoy a more comfortable living, we have designed a premium accessory that can make a real difference in your life: the amazing 3-in-1 wrap dispenser! Easy to install and very practical, this aluminum foil dispenser is key to getting rid of clutter and keeping everything neat and proper. The foil holder provides individual compartments for 3 different rolls, as well as built-in cutters that make it easier to dispense and use just the right amount of aluminum, plastic, or paper roll without wasting it. Slicious Wrap Organizer with Cutter – The Key to an Organized Kitchen This kitchen foil holder is made entirely of bamboo wood that is durable and sustainable too. The 3 roll dispenser features wall-mounting holes so you can easily install them and save important storage space. The foil paper dispenser with cutter is lightweight and reliable, allowing you to insert any type of 12-inch roll with ease. Some features to keep in mind about our product: Features 3 individual compartments; Compatible with rolls measuring 12-inch; Built-in cutters for each compartment; Made of 100% bamboo wood; USPTO Patent pending design; Excellent craftmanship; Ideally used with aluminum foil, plastic wrap, wax paper, and parchment paper; The rolls are easy to insert into the dispenser; Simple and stylish; Excellent customer support; Designed to help you organize your kitchen; Pre-assembled design; Silicone anti-slip pads; Includes 21 labels; Metal blade slide cutter; Wall mounting holes; Giftable box. Enjoy an organized home with our excellent wrap dispenser with cutter!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vS7C-qrGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09W1X93FK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W1X93FK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W1X93FK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
